New T2 with 2 balconies, parking and storage room. Located on the 1st floor of the Varandas do Pinhal development, a contemporary residential project that combines modern architecture, comfort and functionality, in one of the areas with the greatest potential for appreciation on the South Bank.

With excellent sun exposure, this flat stands out for its generous areas, abundant natural light and the intelligent organisation of spaces, providing a practical and comfortable experience for families, couples or investors.

The social area was designed in open space, uniting the living room and the kitchen in a large, bright and welcoming environment, with direct access to one of the balconies. In the private area, you will find a spacious suite, a second bedroom of excellent dimensions and two complete sanitary facilities, ensuring comfort and privacy on a daily basis.

The two balconies, with a total area of 16.48 m², naturally extend the living space, creating the perfect setting for outdoor dining, moments of conviviality or simply to enjoy the tranquillity of the surroundings.

Apartment features

- Living room (24.00 m²) and kitchen (6.95 m²) in open space concept;

- Suite with 17.63 m²;

- Room with 14.72 m²;

- Entrance hall with 4.65 m²;

- Social toilet and private toilet in the suite;

- Two private balconies with a total area of 16.48 m²;

- 1 indoor parking space;

- Private storage room with 5.32 m².

Comfort and efficiency

Designed to meet the demands of modern life, this flat integrates solutions that privilege comfort, energy efficiency and the quality of finishes.

Equipment and finishes:

- Pre-installation of air conditioning;

- Pre-installation of central heating;

- Fully equipped kitchen with Beko appliances;

- Thermosiphon thermal solar panels for the production of domestic hot water (DHW);

- High quality materials and finishes.

The venture

Scheduled for completion in July 2027, Varandas do Pinhal is a residential development consisting of 12 apartments, spread over three floors, with typologies T1, T2 and T3.

Located in the heart of Pinhal do General, next to the future Alameda do Poder Local Garden, which will feature the planting of 254 new trees, it offers a quiet residential environment, surrounded by green spaces and designed to provide a high quality of life.

The building has:

- 2 elevators;

- Indoor parking;

- Collections in most fractions;

- Private terraces on the ground floor fractions;

- Large balconies on the upper floors;

- Excellent sun exposure.

Prime location

Living at Varandas do Pinhal is to benefit from a location that combines tranquillity, nature and excellent accessibility.

A few minutes from Coina Train Station and about 650 meters from a bus stop, it has fast connections to the Fertagus stations of Coina and Fogueteiro, to Lisbon (Sete Rios), Sesimbra and to the Cacilhas River Terminal, passing through Corroios.

Nearby you will also find:

- Commerce and services about 3 minutes away;

- Coina Train Station 5 minutes away;

- Quinta do Perú Golf & Country Club 5 minutes away;

- National and international schools;

- Quick access to N10, IC32 and A33;

- About 20 minutes from Lisbon;

- Approximately 20 minutes from the beaches of Costa da Caparica and Arrábida;

- About 30 minutes from Humberto Delgado Airport.

If you are looking for a new flat, with excellent areas, quality finishes, balcony, parking and storage, inserted in a modern development and in a location in strong growth, this is an opportunity that deserves your attention.

Book your visit now and discover your future flat.

